Output docs/moves.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640

Hide
Type@30ms "mkdir -p /tmp/pokemon-demo && cp dist/pokemon-info /tmp/pokemon-demo/ && export PATH=/tmp/pokemon-demo:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type@90ms "pokemon-info"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type@90ms "/moves"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type@70ms "thunder"
Sleep 2200ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type@90ms "q"
Sleep 500ms
